    remote counterpart is now skipped when the project isn''t linked or has no catalog
    items. If the project''s environments can''t be loaded, the reason now shows
    as the items'' status in the Deployment window instead of as a Console error.\n-
    Authoring - A pending wait for the project to be linked to a cloud project no
    longer keeps the catalog deployment objects alive across a code reload, which
    leaked under CoreCLR.\n- Google Play - `UpgradeDowngradeSubscription(Product,
